Háber János wrote:
> 
> Hi!
> 
> I tested my sound card on with kernel 2.6 internal alsa and kernel 2.4 
> external alsa module. With kernel 2.4 is 2 program use the card sometime the 
> system work correctily, because If do this with kernel 2.6.... the Second 
> program goming to zombie. (or both program)..

sis7012 supports only exclusive access to the device for playback or
capture.  (it's full-duplex, opening playback and capture is
indepedent, though.)
then anyway you cannot use two programs at the same time without help
of sound daemon or ALSA dmix/dsnoop plugins.


